  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "We need to update group moderation tools. All these tools can be easily implemented into the website. I say this because it's taken me 30 minutes to look for someone on the user-banned list in my community VRC group. We need a way to search by user name in bans and the group logs. It would speed up moderation so much. We also need a way to explain why someone was banned or removed from a group instance. \n\nThese tools help speed up and clean up all group moderation throughout VRChat. Another helpful tool would be exporting the group log information in a text format similar to the discord state bot. It would help with group statistics, help us see what our community wants, and help us better document kicks and bans from our group alongside warnings. I see this becoming an excellent outlet for 3rd party developers to make a discord bot or application similar to a state bot so that communities can easily track the progress of their community and grow and easily find past moderation actions in their group.",
